{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1209588-1001-things-the-gold-faction-tells-solars","id":1209588,"title":"1001 things the Gold Faction tells Solars","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-21T05:41:23-07:00","id":1209588,"title":"1001 things the Gold Faction tells Solars","content":"<span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"> The Solars have asked their Sidereal contacts all sorts of inconvenient questions... questions that the Sidereals probably don't want to answer honestly - or at least evasively.<br /> Possible Questions include:<br /> - What exactly happened during the Ursurpation?</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">- Can we go to Yu-Shan?</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">- Can you teach me those cool martial arts moves you are using?</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">- I was attacked by the Wyld Hunt yesterday, and I am sure I saw another Sidereal with them! What was that all about?<br /> <br /> Tell me about your Solar-Sidereal interactions, awkward questions posed by Solars, and about how the Sidereals attempted to weasel out of this.</span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12378-fma245","name":"FMA245","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-21T06:02:54-07:00","id":1209591,"title":"","content":"I regret to say that the one time I was playing a Solar with a Sidereal ally, he was brutally honest with us.<br /> <br /> &quot;We persuaded the Dragon-Blooded to murder you. But you deserved it, you guys were being insane dicks. I have a dreamstone with a dozen horrific memories of Solar atrocities stored on it, you can view it later if you want, but I recommend you don't do it on a full stomach.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Regrettably, the resurgence of Solars into the world has led to people having very different opinions on how to respond to your return. Many gods and Sidereals will have it in for you.&quot;<br /> <br /> And so on. Honestly I kinda wish we'd had a deceptive one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-21T08:00:33-07:00","id":1209627,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1209588-1001-things-the-gold-faction-tells-solars?p=1209591#post1209591\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I regret to say that the one time I was playing a Solar with a Sidereal ally, he was brutally honest with us.<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;We persuaded the Dragon-Blooded to murder you. But you deserved it, you guys were being insane dicks. I have a dreamstone with a dozen horrific memories of Solar atrocities stored on it, you can view it later if you want, but I recommend you don't do it on a full stomach.&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;Regrettably, the resurgence of Solars into the world has led to people having very different opinions on how to respond to your return. Many gods and Sidereals will have it in for you.&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> And so on. Honestly I kinda wish we'd had a deceptive one.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is it mostly because a deceptive one brings more mystery/drama and that there is more tension when the truth is revealed? Out of curiosity what would be your ideal sidereal/solar dynamic for a game you played in?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11967-saipjas","name":"Saipjas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"270"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-21T08:32:36-07:00","id":1209643,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saipjas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1209588-1001-things-the-gold-faction-tells-solars?p=1209627#post1209627\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is it mostly because a deceptive one brings more mystery/drama and that there is more tension when the truth is revealed?</div> </div> </div> </div>Exactly. Plus I worry that, as it was part of my formative Exalted experience, it likely contributed to my perceptions of the game during those first few years being as skewed as they were.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saipjas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1209588-1001-things-the-gold-faction-tells-solars?p=1209627#post1209627\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Out of curiosity what would be your ideal sidereal/solar dynamic for a game you played in?</div> </div> </div> </div>Depends on the game, and the characters.<br /> <br /> Like, if I was to play a warstrider jockey who was the pilot of Karvara the Walking Devil Tower, I'd definitely want a deceptive, manipulative Sidereal mentor for the mental anguish that would follow inevitably.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-21T09:42:32-07:00","id":1209667,"title":"","content":"A choice excerpt from the ridiculous second edition campaign that went off the rails before the circle even hit essence 5:<br /> <br /> &quot;Ow! Fuck! Ow! That's terrible advice!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2223-ketrus","name":"Ketrus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"398"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-22T06:15:17-07:00","id":1210000,"title":"","content":"Leaning heavily on the &quot;fate makes everyone forget we exist&quot; bit, answering questions you don't want PCs getting the answers to yet with &quot;She (or he) tells you.&quot; is always good. In universe, the PCs heard it, but can't remember (and the players don't get the info, so no meta-gaming either). (-Credit to the ExalTwitch stream game for this trick.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12111-the_larz","name":"the_larz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-22T06:25:11-07:00","id":1210004,"title":"","content":"An ST will have to judge on a game-to-game basis what the sids will want to tell the players - and once the players know from one game, it can be very difficult to avoid meta exploitation.<br /> <br /> As for explaining the usurpation - again, all depends on the Sid they're talking to. Does the sid want to sugar-coat things, or just paint the bronze faction as bad guys? What does the Sid want out of the solars?<br /> <br /> Regarding SMAs - again - the players want it, but they need a teacher. is anyone willing to teach? What can they offer to the teacher? It makes for a powerful bargaining chip if nothing else, though once that door is opened it can be difficult to close, though the teacher might not always be available... and there's a big difference between learning a single SMA charm or being promised to be taught a whole style.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-22T18:00:44-07:00","id":1210199,"title":"","content":"Well I dunno about y'all, but last time I was a Gold Faction Sid I took the Brachiation merit and the chaos-powered body morphing amulet from Dreams if the First Age, a Moonsilver weapon, and the resplendent destiny trick that lets you turn into a crow, and I made a resplendence for &quot;your destined liver across the ages, your long lost Lunar Mate&quot; and I just hung out with the Solar Circle and aimed them at threats to Creation and never mentioned that Sidereals or Yu Shan existed.<br /> <br /> Edit-growing orange fur, prehensile feet, and Brachiation let me pull off&quot;I am definitely an orangutan totem lunar.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":512,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","user":"Wise Old Guru","date":". 04-22-2018, 09:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}